#
# Measurement artefacts and build output. Read them, put the summary in the
# Results section of docs/spikes/G1-destruction-remesh.md, and let them be
# deleted (spikes/README.md, "Build outputs are git-ignored").

target/
results/
meshbench.json

# Godot's per-project import cache and the staged cdylib, both regenerated.
godot/.godot/
godot/bin/
*.import
*.translation

# The golden vista is NOT a measurement artefact: it is the only assertion the
# CI `geometry` job has, and a job whose golden is missing cannot check
# anything. spikes/README.md allows exactly this kind of exception for evidence
# that has to survive — commit it force-added if a broader ignore ever catches
# it, and regenerate it only after eyeballing the replacement for cracks,
# missing faces and inverted winding.
!ci/golden/
!ci/golden/*.png
